WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Ada Lovelace>Okay, I think that's everyone. Let's start with the dashboard.</v>

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Grace Hopper>Yeah, the exec dashboard broke again on Tuesday. The refresh failed and nobody noticed until Sanjay pinged me Wednesday afternoon asking why the numbers were two days stale.</v>

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
<v Ada Lovelace>Failed as in no alert fired?</v>

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
<v Grace Hopper>No alert. The job status said succeeded, because the extract technically completed. It just pulled zero rows.</v>

5
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Ada Lovelace>That's the second time this month.</v>

6
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Grace Hopper>Third, if you count the one in the first week.</v>

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:54.000
<v Ada Lovelace>Alright, I'll fix the refresh and put a row-count check on it, so it actually fails loudly when it pulls nothing. End of week, it's not a big change.</v>

8
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
<v Grace Hopper>Good.</v>

9
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:05.000
